WEBVTT

01:49.320 --> 01:54.990
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.030 --> 01:57.850
[Episode 17]

02:03.070 --> 02:03.920
What is it?

02:03.920 --> 02:04.850
What's going on?

02:06.310 --> 02:08.960
I heard your Chief Master's called
something like "Liu"?

02:08.960 --> 02:10.800
I'm known as "Thriver" on the streets,

02:10.800 --> 02:13.960
specializing in dealing with these famous
troublemakers in the martial world.

02:13.960 --> 02:14.900
Hurry up

02:15.080 --> 02:16.880
and tell him to come out to see me!

02:17.430 --> 02:18.190
Boss.

02:19.000 --> 02:20.640
This woman is so pretty.

02:30.150 --> 02:30.960
Miss.

02:31.400 --> 02:33.680
Do I look like your future husband?

02:33.870 --> 02:34.820
More like a fly.

02:35.710 --> 02:36.520
Miss.

02:38.960 --> 02:40.000
So beautiful.

02:42.360 --> 02:43.000
Boss!

02:43.240 --> 02:43.870
Boss!

02:44.150 --> 02:45.210
Are you okay, Boss?

02:46.870 --> 02:48.430
Capture that woman!

02:48.430 --> 02:49.120
Yes!

02:49.150 --> 02:49.960
Stop!

02:52.260 --> 02:54.590
Phantom dragon lurks in the black market.

02:54.650 --> 02:57.380
Radiant lanterns
illuminate the Nightwalkers.

02:59.940 --> 03:02.660
♪ Phantom dragon
lurks in the black market ♪

03:04.430 --> 03:07.540
♪ Radiant lanterns
illuminate the Nightwalkers ♪

03:07.470 --> 03:08.800
It's the Moon Immortal.

03:09.440 --> 03:11.260
♪ In the dark of night,
pure dreams run deep and wide ♪

03:12.030 --> 03:13.890
♪ Who dares to join the game?
This isn't child's play ♪

03:14.920 --> 03:15.800
Shangguan.

03:15.960 --> 03:16.750
The flute.

03:26.590 --> 03:29.390
Are you the one who's called something
like "Liu?"

03:29.870 --> 03:30.960
On the streets, I go by the name...

03:30.960 --> 03:31.840
Sir,

03:32.470 --> 03:33.840
you ruined our stage.

03:34.710 --> 03:35.520
The fine is

03:36.150 --> 03:37.280
200 taels of silver.

03:38.000 --> 03:39.000
On the streets, I go by the name...

03:39.000 --> 03:39.840
Miss,

03:39.910 --> 03:41.280
you broke our wine jar.

03:41.590 --> 03:43.250
The fine is 50 taels of silver.

03:44.430 --> 03:45.560
But this gentleman

03:45.560 --> 03:46.960
disturbed this young lady,

03:46.960 --> 03:48.240
which was truly uncalled for.

03:48.240 --> 03:49.430
In my opinion,

03:49.680 --> 03:51.140
the fine for the young lady

03:51.150 --> 03:53.280
should be put on this gentleman's tab.

03:53.360 --> 03:54.079
Please pay.

03:54.079 --> 03:55.280
On the streets, I go by the name...

03:55.280 --> 03:56.480
Master Thief Shanhu.

04:01.560 --> 04:02.820
It seems this crappy ax

04:02.870 --> 04:04.130
is worth some pennies.

04:04.430 --> 04:05.240
How about

04:05.870 --> 04:07.330
giving it to the young lady

04:07.800 --> 04:08.860
to calm her nerves?

04:18.360 --> 04:19.160
Look.

04:19.240 --> 04:21.310
Your ax has disturbed this
young lady again.

04:21.310 --> 04:22.840
Kneel and plead guilty now.

04:24.070 --> 04:25.430
You bastard "Liu" something...

04:25.430 --> 04:26.360
Speedy Yunlong.

04:32.800 --> 04:34.190
Even your boss is already on his knees.

04:34.190 --> 04:35.590
What are you waiting for?

04:43.920 --> 04:44.720
Peonies?

04:46.090 --> 04:47.330
Tacky.

04:47.630 --> 04:48.630
Lotuses?

04:49.830 --> 04:50.630
Mediocre.

04:52.430 --> 04:53.240
Roses?

04:54.190 --> 04:55.070
Dull.

05:02.560 --> 05:04.600
A fine sword suits a
noble gentleman;

05:04.600 --> 05:06.720
and jade bamboo is a gift for
a beautiful lady.

05:06.720 --> 05:07.680
Miss, may I ask

05:08.360 --> 05:09.590
your gracious name?

05:13.070 --> 05:14.330
No need for honorifics.

05:14.330 --> 05:15.680
I live in the west of the city

05:15.680 --> 05:17.430
outside the Shiqiao Gate, at the Duke of
Guangping's Residence,

05:17.430 --> 05:19.630
who's Left Vice Minister of the Imperial Secretariat
and concurrently Minister of War.

05:19.630 --> 05:21.040
My name is Song Yiting.

05:29.360 --> 05:30.400
Chu Guihong.

05:31.040 --> 05:32.970
Since you had the guts to shoot him,

05:33.070 --> 05:34.560
how come you don't have the guts
to clean up the mess?

05:34.560 --> 05:35.680
And you come here now, expecting me

05:35.680 --> 05:37.280
to clean up this mess for you?

05:39.430 --> 05:40.240
Well...

05:40.240 --> 05:41.040
Father.

05:41.120 --> 05:41.800
You know,

05:41.800 --> 05:42.630
with Heng's skills,

05:42.630 --> 05:44.270
there's no way he would've failed to
dodge that arrow.

05:44.270 --> 05:45.510
He must have done it on purpose.

05:45.510 --> 05:47.870
He... He had long planned to kick Guihong
out of the capital.

05:47.870 --> 05:49.480
Don't you fall into his trap.

05:49.480 --> 05:50.240
Shut up!

05:52.000 --> 05:53.380
You useless thing.

05:56.560 --> 05:57.620
Your Majesty.

05:58.040 --> 06:00.190
I am to blame for what happened
at the stables.

06:00.190 --> 06:01.160
But the Seventh Prince

06:01.160 --> 06:02.800
networks with top officials at court,

06:02.800 --> 06:04.510
forges alliances with underworld
forces outside the court,

06:04.510 --> 06:06.430
has control over the major force of
the Xuanjia Army,

06:06.430 --> 06:07.800
and even seeks to strengthen his power

06:07.800 --> 06:09.800
through a marriage alliance
with the Song family.

06:09.800 --> 06:12.510
Such treacherous ambitions are
blatantly obvious.

06:12.510 --> 06:14.910
Please make a wise decision, Your Majesty.

06:21.480 --> 06:22.280
Your Majesty.

06:22.510 --> 06:23.310
Your Majesty!

06:26.190 --> 06:26.950
Your Majesty.

06:26.950 --> 06:30.410
Chancellor Gao and the others have
arrived at the palace gate.

06:30.630 --> 06:32.360
Are they trying to stage a coup?

06:37.390 --> 06:38.970
What do you gentlemen intend to do?

06:38.970 --> 06:40.930
Don't stir up trouble here!

06:40.960 --> 06:42.440
If you anger His Majesty,

06:42.460 --> 06:44.460
I'm afraid you'll face punishment!

06:48.360 --> 06:50.159
Chu Guihong shot the prince,

06:50.159 --> 06:51.390
which is unforgivable.

06:51.390 --> 06:52.600
I, Yao Qian,

06:52.600 --> 06:54.970
beg Your Majesty to judge wisely.

06:55.430 --> 06:57.760
Your Majesty, please judge wisely!

07:12.390 --> 07:13.430
If you keep sighing like that,

07:13.430 --> 07:15.230
you might just sigh my soul away.

07:22.480 --> 07:23.390
Help me up.

07:33.670 --> 07:35.020
Be gentler, okay?

07:36.800 --> 07:38.240
Your Highness,

07:38.260 --> 07:39.659
what a smart tactic.

07:40.270 --> 07:42.600
You used me to irritate Chu Guihong again.

07:42.800 --> 07:44.800
Now His Majesty is furious in the palace,

07:44.800 --> 07:46.750
and you've made a stir
in the entire court.

07:46.750 --> 07:49.280
Don't you think you've gone too far
this time?

07:49.510 --> 07:51.750
Didn't you say my tactic was
old-fashioned?

07:51.750 --> 07:53.040
As long as it works, right?

07:53.040 --> 07:53.830
You...

07:56.600 --> 07:57.920
Only someone like you

07:57.920 --> 07:59.270
would come up with a move that
does even more harm

07:59.270 --> 08:00.930
to yourself than to the enemy.

08:02.070 --> 08:03.630
If I didn't risked myself

08:04.000 --> 08:06.070
to make Chu Guihong commit
a grave mistake,

08:06.070 --> 08:08.390
how could you break off the
engagement with him?

08:08.390 --> 08:09.560
And I'm telling you,

08:10.360 --> 08:11.390
when they come in a while,

08:11.390 --> 08:12.800
be clear in your mind about

08:12.800 --> 08:14.190
what's safe to say and what's not.

08:14.190 --> 08:15.950
We are on the same boat.

08:17.160 --> 08:18.390
I'm telling you too.

08:18.800 --> 08:19.920
Breaking off the engagement

08:19.920 --> 08:21.000
and marrying you

08:21.000 --> 08:22.400
are two separate things.

08:26.920 --> 08:28.430
You're the God of Death.

08:28.510 --> 08:30.530
You must keep your word.

08:30.600 --> 08:32.600
Don't try to play dirty, you hear me?

08:33.000 --> 08:34.289
Do you hear me?

08:34.630 --> 08:35.200
It hurts.

08:35.200 --> 08:36.030
Do you hear me?

08:40.390 --> 08:42.150
Who's the one playing dirty?

08:44.000 --> 08:46.120
Your Highness, now you know
what pain feels like?

08:46.120 --> 08:47.200
Then why didn't you dodge

08:47.200 --> 08:48.330
that arrow just now?

08:48.440 --> 08:49.240
I...

08:50.510 --> 08:51.960
His Majesty is here.

08:57.150 --> 08:58.010
Your Highness.

08:58.150 --> 08:59.790
Your Highness, are you alright?

08:59.790 --> 09:01.590
Why are you bleeding so much?

09:01.720 --> 09:02.630
Hang in there.

09:02.670 --> 09:04.960
The imperial physician will be here
in no time.

09:04.960 --> 09:05.750
My Lady.

09:07.200 --> 09:07.960
Mother.

09:07.960 --> 09:09.440
Why are you bleeding so much again?

09:09.440 --> 09:10.750
I-It was her.

09:11.120 --> 09:11.790
Just now, she...

09:11.790 --> 09:12.440
My Lady.

09:12.910 --> 09:14.240
It's all my fault.

09:14.390 --> 09:15.790
Sorry for making you worry.

09:15.790 --> 09:16.670
Good girl.

09:16.690 --> 09:18.350
You're just too concerned.

09:33.120 --> 09:34.200
Heng, come on.

09:34.200 --> 09:35.030
Be careful, Your Highness.

09:35.030 --> 09:35.790
Slowly.

09:38.200 --> 09:38.870
Be careful.

09:38.870 --> 09:39.790
Slowly.

09:49.790 --> 09:51.250
Greetings, Your Majesty.

10:00.390 --> 10:01.200
Song.

10:01.480 --> 10:02.390
You rise first.

10:07.640 --> 10:09.040
Thank you, Your Majesty.

10:11.960 --> 10:12.750
You!

10:16.550 --> 10:17.360
Answer me.

10:19.030 --> 10:19.840
Yes.

10:21.200 --> 10:22.250
Your Majesty.

10:22.280 --> 10:23.810
Heng is severely injured.

10:24.000 --> 10:26.020
Might he rise first and answer you?

10:26.120 --> 10:27.550
Your uncle is inciting officials outside
the palace gate

10:27.550 --> 10:29.330
to stage a coup.

10:29.720 --> 10:30.510
What,

10:30.870 --> 10:33.160
are you trying to defy me here as well?

10:33.290 --> 10:34.210
I dare not.

10:49.080 --> 10:51.280
How do you intend to punish Chu Guihong?

10:53.120 --> 10:53.960
Your Majesty.

10:57.960 --> 10:58.960
Your Highness...

11:02.790 --> 11:04.790
Chu Guihong is the capital prefect

11:05.600 --> 11:08.060
and the only surviving child
of Lord Qianyu.

11:08.150 --> 11:10.280
He's also a great talent to our nation.

11:10.670 --> 11:11.930
If he's to be punished,

11:12.550 --> 11:15.600
I believe all the officials will
be disappointed as well.

11:15.600 --> 11:16.600
But according to the law of Great Jing,

11:16.600 --> 11:17.800
Article 8 states that

11:18.600 --> 11:21.260
plotting to harm a member
of the royal family...

11:23.550 --> 11:25.840
Plotting to harm a member
of the royal family

11:25.840 --> 11:27.440
shall be regarded as treason

11:28.150 --> 11:30.550
and shall be executed
according to the law.

11:30.750 --> 11:32.350
So, Your Majesty, I'm just as

11:33.150 --> 11:34.600
conflicted as you are.

11:48.270 --> 11:49.790
Being so seriously injured,

11:49.790 --> 11:51.510
yet you're still concerned about

11:51.510 --> 11:52.670
my difficulties.

11:53.240 --> 11:55.720
Heng, you do put the bigger picture first.

12:03.200 --> 12:05.150
But I see your arrow wound

12:06.080 --> 12:09.000
is about an inch above the left
side of your chest.

12:09.790 --> 12:11.920
I suppose it's not very serious, is it?

12:13.480 --> 12:15.810
Thank you for your concern, Your Majesty.

12:16.290 --> 12:17.690
But if Your Majesty would

12:18.200 --> 12:19.000
graciously revoke the decree

12:19.000 --> 12:20.400
and annul the engagement

12:20.720 --> 12:23.280
between Miss Song and Chu Guihong,

12:24.000 --> 12:25.330
then the knot in my heart

12:25.630 --> 12:27.160
would be untied,

12:27.960 --> 12:29.220
and I believe my wounds

12:29.510 --> 12:30.840
would heal faster.

12:33.600 --> 12:34.870
So about what happened at the
stables today...

12:34.870 --> 12:36.270
I was just fooling around

12:36.910 --> 12:38.710
with Chu Guihong at the stables.

12:39.200 --> 12:40.360
We were merely fooling around,

12:40.360 --> 12:41.790
so a few bumps were inevitable.

12:41.790 --> 12:43.050
It's nothing serious.

12:46.960 --> 12:48.720
Since it's a simple misunderstanding,

12:48.720 --> 12:50.450
this should be easy to resolve.

12:52.200 --> 12:53.060
Song.

12:54.150 --> 12:55.030
Tell me,

12:56.360 --> 12:58.840
do you have feelings for General Chu?

12:59.630 --> 13:00.440
Your Majesty,

13:00.510 --> 13:02.440
I have absolutely no improper thoughts
toward him.

13:02.440 --> 13:03.240
Alright.

13:04.720 --> 13:05.960
Though the imperial edict for
your betrothal

13:05.960 --> 13:07.830
was issued 18 years ago,

13:08.080 --> 13:09.270
since there's no affection

13:09.270 --> 13:10.840
between you two now,

13:11.120 --> 13:11.910
I

13:12.000 --> 13:15.440
have no wish to add yet another pair
of ill-fated couple to the world.

13:15.440 --> 13:16.790
I hereby declare that

13:17.600 --> 13:19.200
this betrothal is annulled.

13:25.440 --> 13:26.240
However,

13:27.630 --> 13:29.230
Song is not young anymore,

13:29.510 --> 13:31.480
and Song Yude is already aged.

13:31.870 --> 13:33.200
He has long hoped to see
his children married

13:33.200 --> 13:34.510
and live out his remaining days in peace.

13:34.510 --> 13:35.750
His wishes align closely

13:35.750 --> 13:38.000
with mine.

13:38.510 --> 13:40.360
Although this betrothal has been
cancelled,

13:40.360 --> 13:41.030
it must be

13:41.390 --> 13:43.440
made up for with another.

13:43.910 --> 13:44.790
Liu Mingxi.

13:45.360 --> 13:46.160
Your Majesty.

13:46.600 --> 13:48.310
Bring my jade seal.

13:48.840 --> 13:49.630
Today,

13:50.000 --> 13:51.840
in front of the Noble Consort,

13:52.320 --> 13:55.030
I'll betroth Song as Heng's
principal consort.

13:56.080 --> 13:57.630
Your Majesty, that's not right.

13:57.630 --> 13:59.200
This is supposed to be just a broken
betrothal, Your Majesty.

13:59.200 --> 14:01.030
Thank you for granting our marriage,
Your Majesty.

14:01.030 --> 14:01.840
I...

14:05.120 --> 14:06.160
By the way,

14:07.000 --> 14:09.440
there was an old custom
in the previous dynasty

14:09.440 --> 14:11.910
that once a prince gets married,
he must go and govern his fief.

14:11.910 --> 14:13.790
Now that you've been bestowed
a principal consort,

14:13.790 --> 14:15.270
once you recover from your injury,

14:15.270 --> 14:16.120
you shall set out

14:16.120 --> 14:17.600
for your fief.

14:20.080 --> 14:20.870
Your Maj...

15:26.550 --> 15:27.610
Since you're here,

15:28.000 --> 15:29.400
come have a drink with me.

16:02.000 --> 16:03.810
I never expected

16:05.000 --> 16:05.840
this place

16:06.630 --> 16:07.960
to be so complicated.

16:09.390 --> 16:11.250
The good people I once believed in

16:12.270 --> 16:13.300
might not

16:13.600 --> 16:14.730
be so good after all.

16:16.630 --> 16:19.120
And the ones I thought were bad

16:19.910 --> 16:21.090
might

16:21.120 --> 16:22.580
have their own struggles.

16:24.910 --> 16:25.720
Here?

16:27.360 --> 16:28.300
You mean

16:28.840 --> 16:30.500
you came from somewhere else?

16:34.790 --> 16:36.200
But who's not?

16:37.960 --> 16:39.460
We are all visitors here,

16:39.960 --> 16:42.200
unable to escape from this worldly cage.

16:42.200 --> 16:43.230
Everyone

16:44.000 --> 16:46.800
have responsibilities they can't
walk away from.

16:47.360 --> 16:48.570
You're like this,

16:49.200 --> 16:50.270
so am I,

16:51.120 --> 16:52.550
and so is everyone.

16:55.600 --> 16:57.190
I never noticed before

16:57.600 --> 16:59.080
that as the second female lead,

16:59.080 --> 17:01.140
you're actually quite open-minded.

17:01.750 --> 17:03.080
The second female lead?

17:05.310 --> 17:06.369
It doesn't matter.

17:07.400 --> 17:08.599
What matters is

17:08.750 --> 17:10.310
you're more persistent than me.

17:10.310 --> 17:11.400
You said you wouldn't get married,

17:11.400 --> 17:12.599
and you've held to it.

17:14.589 --> 17:15.839
Don't you think

17:16.400 --> 17:17.750
that's strange of me?

17:18.880 --> 17:20.000
No.

17:20.550 --> 17:21.880
Not at all.

17:21.960 --> 17:23.359
I think it's a good thing.

17:23.750 --> 17:25.240
You should always hold on to

17:25.240 --> 17:26.920
everything you desire.

17:27.270 --> 17:29.440
Don't ever let worldly norms,

17:29.480 --> 17:30.680
responsibilities,

17:30.720 --> 17:32.450
or royal orders weigh you down.

17:34.000 --> 17:36.060
Since you've thought it all through,

17:36.200 --> 17:37.350
why are you still here

17:37.350 --> 17:39.350
drinking away your sorrows with me?

17:45.550 --> 17:47.960
Because things are out of my hands.

17:49.400 --> 17:51.590
The one I like doesn't like me back,

17:52.720 --> 17:55.200
the one I don't like was injured by me,

17:56.310 --> 17:58.960
and there's another one who I want to
run away from but can't

17:58.960 --> 18:01.030
because we're bound by fate.

18:03.000 --> 18:03.930
I understand.

18:05.000 --> 18:06.040
In the past,

18:06.440 --> 18:08.200
I didn't know what love was.

18:09.110 --> 18:10.640
But now that I know,

18:11.070 --> 18:13.000
I'm not as carefree as I used to be.

18:17.790 --> 18:19.450
You fell in love with someone?

18:20.960 --> 18:22.000
Could it be...

18:22.000 --> 18:22.640
Be...

18:23.350 --> 18:24.000
Be...

18:24.200 --> 18:25.200
Nan Heng?

18:25.550 --> 18:26.550
Of course not.

18:29.570 --> 18:30.980
That's good.

18:31.040 --> 18:32.370
You scared me.

18:33.050 --> 18:34.540
Remember, Song Yiting.

18:35.000 --> 18:36.400
Once you get involved with Nan Heng,

18:36.400 --> 18:38.070
it'll be the beginning of your misfortune.

18:38.070 --> 18:39.200
You must never

18:39.200 --> 18:40.660
have any contact with him,

18:40.720 --> 18:41.960
especially not

18:42.200 --> 18:43.410
by the water,

18:43.480 --> 18:44.400
in private rooms,

18:44.400 --> 18:45.270
or during any assassination attempts.

18:45.270 --> 18:46.030
Never.

18:46.270 --> 18:47.240
Do you hear me?

18:49.200 --> 18:51.000
Aren't these exactly the things

18:51.000 --> 18:53.000
you went through with him?

18:53.160 --> 18:54.800
This... This is different.

18:54.880 --> 18:56.000
How?

18:56.000 --> 18:57.390
You don't like Nan Heng,

18:57.440 --> 18:59.050
but you spend a lot of time with him.

18:59.050 --> 19:00.880
Affection inevitably grows over time.

19:00.880 --> 19:02.160
Instead of worrying about me,

19:02.160 --> 19:04.000
you should worry more about yourself.

19:04.000 --> 19:04.830
At least,

19:04.980 --> 19:06.590
I know how I feel.

19:06.590 --> 19:07.650
But what about you?

19:07.830 --> 19:09.000
Do you really know

19:09.310 --> 19:10.720
what kind of person

19:10.720 --> 19:11.960
you truly like?

19:14.440 --> 19:15.880
Of course I do.

19:17.270 --> 19:18.900
I like...

19:20.480 --> 19:21.440
I like...

19:22.070 --> 19:23.800
You like Father and Mother,

19:23.920 --> 19:25.310
you like Zhixia and Yingqiu,

19:25.310 --> 19:26.170
and you like me.

19:26.920 --> 19:28.440
You seem to like everyone,

19:28.590 --> 19:29.920
but it actually shows that

19:29.920 --> 19:31.180
you don't love anyone.

19:32.350 --> 19:33.430
Sometimes,

19:33.890 --> 19:35.890
I think you're a bit weird.

19:36.510 --> 19:39.070
You seem to be happy around everyone,

19:40.000 --> 19:41.550
but you've never really

19:41.790 --> 19:43.190
had feelings for anyone,

19:43.200 --> 19:45.730
nor have you ever really tried to
know anyone.

19:48.240 --> 19:49.000
Song Yimeng.

19:50.120 --> 19:52.920
If you keep treating this place
as somewhere else,

19:53.110 --> 19:55.200
you'll never live this life well.

20:03.960 --> 20:04.960
So His Majesty knows that

20:04.960 --> 20:07.270
sending princes to govern fiefs is merely
an old custom from the previous dynasty?

20:07.270 --> 20:08.920
But since the founding of our dynasty,

20:08.920 --> 20:10.790
there has never been a precedent of

20:10.790 --> 20:13.070
a prince being sent to a fief
upon marriage.

20:13.070 --> 20:14.920
Is His Majesty trying to use you
as a pawn,

20:14.920 --> 20:16.110
sending you far away

20:16.110 --> 20:18.070
to pave the way for the Eighteenth Prince?

20:18.070 --> 20:19.110
His Majesty

20:19.270 --> 20:21.000
is so biased.

20:43.200 --> 20:45.330
Why are you here again, string puller?

20:45.590 --> 20:47.920
Chief is injured. I'm here to
check on him.

20:52.070 --> 20:52.880
Also,

20:54.000 --> 20:54.950
someone

20:55.000 --> 20:56.530
asked me

20:56.590 --> 20:57.790
to give this to you.

20:58.310 --> 20:59.400
Enjoy your drinks.

21:00.160 --> 21:01.380
I... I'll just put

21:01.680 --> 21:02.960
it here.

21:04.920 --> 21:05.720
Come back.

21:11.880 --> 21:12.790
Anything else?

21:13.310 --> 21:14.110
What is it?

21:14.920 --> 21:16.550
This... This...

21:17.240 --> 21:18.030
Open it.

21:19.110 --> 21:21.970
I don't think it's appropriate.
It's a gift for you.

21:22.000 --> 21:22.830
I...

21:23.830 --> 21:24.880
His Highness asked you to open it.

21:24.880 --> 21:26.200
Do I have to repeat it?

21:26.200 --> 21:26.920
Hurry up!

21:26.920 --> 21:27.550
You...

21:31.100 --> 21:34.150
[Painting of the Exiled Immortal
Under the Moon]

21:34.840 --> 21:38.030
[Painting of the Exiled Immortal
Under the Moon]

21:43.750 --> 21:46.410
Painting of the Exiled Immortal
Under the Moon?

21:48.240 --> 21:49.000
This...

21:49.590 --> 21:50.440
This...

21:50.130 --> 21:53.210
[Painting of the Exiled Immortal
Under the Moon]

21:50.720 --> 21:53.670
Miss Song Yiting intends to
befriend you, Chief,

21:53.960 --> 21:55.270
so she specially left you this painting,

21:55.270 --> 21:58.350
hoping you understand her feelings.

21:59.500 --> 22:01.560
I guess she's fallen in love with you.

22:02.930 --> 22:04.190
Fallen in love with me?

22:06.480 --> 22:08.810
I've never even gotten a clear
look at her.

22:08.840 --> 22:11.170
How could there be any feeling between us?

22:13.660 --> 22:14.470
Well...

22:17.000 --> 22:17.830
Explain it!

22:29.660 --> 22:31.320
[Gentle Breeze, Pleasant Weather]

22:49.000 --> 22:49.830
My Lady.

22:49.920 --> 22:51.160
It's so late.

22:51.480 --> 22:52.720
What are you doing?

22:53.310 --> 22:54.880
I'm meditating.

22:57.480 --> 22:58.830
Logically speaking,

22:59.400 --> 23:02.110
I should first marry Chu Guihong,

23:02.400 --> 23:03.930
then break the engagement,

23:04.200 --> 23:06.200
then get stabbed by Nan Heng,

23:09.070 --> 23:10.640
and only after all that should

23:10.640 --> 23:12.770
the story move to me marrying Nan Heng.

23:14.640 --> 23:16.070
Why is the plot developing

23:16.070 --> 23:18.270
so quickly all of a sudden?

23:20.160 --> 23:20.960
Could it be

23:22.030 --> 23:23.680
I've really changed my fate?

23:25.070 --> 23:25.880
My Lady.

23:26.440 --> 23:28.920
You're about to be the Prince's consort.

23:29.440 --> 23:30.830
It's time you got rid of

23:30.830 --> 23:32.490
those superstitious habits.

23:35.330 --> 23:39.430
[Slacker Escape Plan]

23:35.830 --> 23:37.220
I'll never be

23:37.590 --> 23:39.030
the Prince's consort.

23:39.680 --> 23:41.560
And once the plot is changed,

23:42.240 --> 23:43.720
there's no going back.

23:46.000 --> 23:47.640
As for breaking off engagements,

23:47.640 --> 23:50.240
I'm familiar with it now that
I've done it once.

23:50.270 --> 23:51.400
Nan Heng

23:51.400 --> 23:52.590
wants to marry me?

23:52.790 --> 23:53.590
Bah!

23:54.000 --> 23:55.960
Let him dream on.

23:56.100 --> 23:58.250
[Slacker Escape Plan]

23:57.590 --> 23:58.440
My Lady.

23:58.250 --> 23:59.510
[Iconic Scenes in the Script]

23:59.600 --> 24:03.200
[3. Family Rift over Wild
Vegetable Foraging]

24:03.250 --> 24:07.620
[Song Residence]

24:03.680 --> 24:04.790
His Majesty hereby decrees,

24:04.790 --> 24:08.030
the eldest daughter of Song Yude,
the Duke of Guangping,

24:08.030 --> 24:10.590
Left Vice Minister of the Imperial
Secretariat, concurrently Minister of War,

24:10.590 --> 24:12.070
is gentle and obedient by nature,

24:12.070 --> 24:13.590
calm and tolerant.

24:13.640 --> 24:15.590
Her words always conform to the
rules of history,

24:15.590 --> 24:17.830
and her conduct follows the standards
of propriety.

24:17.830 --> 24:20.560
She's worthy to be favored in
the imperial palace

24:20.580 --> 24:22.680
and to share the noble duty of a
prince's wife.

24:22.680 --> 24:24.830
Song Yude's daughter shall be wed
as Consort to the Seventh Prince.

24:24.830 --> 24:27.640
The relevant officials are hereby instructed
to prepare the ceremonial rites and official decree.

24:24.930 --> 24:29.070
[Imperial Edict]

24:30.440 --> 24:31.440
Miss Song.

24:31.720 --> 24:34.380
You strove so hard to secure
this marriage.

24:34.830 --> 24:35.950
Accept the edict.

24:42.200 --> 24:43.150
Eunuch Liu.

24:43.720 --> 24:44.720
May I ask,

24:45.030 --> 24:46.530
what happens if

24:47.000 --> 24:48.480
I don't accept this imperial edict?

24:48.480 --> 24:50.080
Defying the imperial edict?

24:50.240 --> 24:51.670
That's simple.

24:51.880 --> 24:53.000
The family shall be raided and wiped out,

24:53.000 --> 24:54.440
torn limb from limb by five horses,

24:54.440 --> 24:55.550
the males conscripted into forced labor,

24:55.550 --> 24:57.440
and the females sold into servitude.

24:57.440 --> 24:58.440
Miss Song.

24:58.590 --> 24:59.790
The choice is yours.

25:01.070 --> 25:01.880
Alright.

25:02.510 --> 25:04.040
I understand what you mean.

25:05.240 --> 25:06.350
Well,

25:06.830 --> 25:08.240
I have another question.

25:08.550 --> 25:10.150
Does the Seventh Prince know

25:10.240 --> 25:11.960
that you're coming to announce
the edict today?

25:11.960 --> 25:13.440
Didn't His Majesty say yesterday that

25:13.440 --> 25:14.310
when a prince gets married,

25:14.310 --> 25:15.640
he'll be sent to govern a fief?

25:15.640 --> 25:16.590
I think

25:16.590 --> 25:18.680
I'd better discuss this with
the Seventh Prince first.

25:18.680 --> 25:19.490
Look...

25:19.590 --> 25:21.590
This edict is for you, Miss.

25:21.640 --> 25:22.830
You don't need to worry

25:22.830 --> 25:24.440
about His Highness's part.

25:24.550 --> 25:25.350
Miss.

25:25.480 --> 25:26.720
Go on and accept the edict.

25:26.720 --> 25:27.930
Otherwise...

25:36.820 --> 25:38.230
I... I'll accept it.

25:48.110 --> 25:48.920
Wait.

25:51.070 --> 25:51.880
Father?

25:53.510 --> 25:54.540
Honey?

25:56.830 --> 25:57.590
You mustn't.

25:59.510 --> 26:00.590
Mr. Song.

26:01.030 --> 26:03.310
Are you trying to defy His
Majesty's order?

26:03.310 --> 26:04.710
I'll go back to the palace

26:04.750 --> 26:07.000
and report this to His Majesty.

26:07.750 --> 26:10.200
You don't have to go alone, Eunuch Liu.

26:11.790 --> 26:14.480
I'll go with you to see His Majesty.

26:15.000 --> 26:16.060
There's something

26:16.310 --> 26:18.640
I want to ask His Majesty in person.

26:19.510 --> 26:21.440
18 years ago, His Majesty issued
the edict solemnly,

26:21.440 --> 26:23.310
and now, he's going back on his words.

26:23.310 --> 26:27.170
Can His Majesty face the noble spirit
of Lord Qianyu in the afterlife?

26:28.340 --> 26:30.210
Is this part of the script?

26:32.660 --> 26:33.710
Father!

26:33.250 --> 26:40.070
[Scene 13, Episode 17
Dream of Qingning]

26:35.240 --> 26:36.400
Chu Guihong and I

26:37.240 --> 26:38.970
were betrothed by our parents.

26:39.510 --> 26:41.070
There's no affection between us.

26:41.070 --> 26:43.070
But it's different
with the Seventh Prince.

26:43.070 --> 26:45.200
We are truly in love with each other.

26:47.550 --> 26:48.550
The iconic scene?

26:49.000 --> 26:50.330
It can't be here, right?

26:50.590 --> 26:51.440
Honey!

26:52.030 --> 26:52.790
Honey!

26:52.790 --> 26:54.120
Are you out of your mind?

26:54.200 --> 26:56.240
You've always adhered to the
Doctrine of the Mean

26:56.240 --> 26:57.310
and handled matters with tact.

26:57.310 --> 26:59.000
You especially avoid making enemies.

26:59.000 --> 27:00.590
If you go defy the imperial edict,

27:00.590 --> 27:03.190
you'll be offending the entire
royal family.

27:03.790 --> 27:05.400
Are you giving up your position?

27:05.400 --> 27:07.510
Are you giving up our entire Song family?

27:07.510 --> 27:08.240
Shut up.

27:08.830 --> 27:11.000
Only by self-cultivation and
family harmony

27:11.000 --> 27:13.660
can a noble person shine virtue
across the land.

27:14.000 --> 27:15.130
Step aside, you all.

27:15.750 --> 27:16.880
I've made up my mind.

27:16.920 --> 27:17.480
Honey!

27:17.480 --> 27:18.940
Father, please calm down.

27:19.030 --> 27:19.830
This marriage

27:19.830 --> 27:21.200
has already displeased His Majesty.

27:21.200 --> 27:22.590
If you continue to defy the imperial will,

27:22.590 --> 27:24.920
you'll only make things worse for Yimeng.

27:25.160 --> 27:26.240
Honey, if you insist

27:26.240 --> 27:27.880
on defying the imperial edict,

27:27.880 --> 27:30.240
step over my body!

27:30.270 --> 27:31.590
Master, please think twice!

27:31.590 --> 27:33.750
Master, please think twice!

27:35.240 --> 27:36.200
Honey...

27:37.920 --> 27:39.850
I've been an official for decades.

27:41.350 --> 27:43.720
I still have some dignity in the court.

27:46.480 --> 27:47.350
My daughter

27:48.270 --> 27:50.330
will never marry the Seventh Prince!

27:50.830 --> 27:52.390
No one can stop me!

27:59.440 --> 28:01.150
Father... Father...

28:01.240 --> 28:02.570
Shut up!

28:09.750 --> 28:10.790
Father!

28:12.430 --> 28:14.340
[Persistence]

28:23.240 --> 28:24.000
Father.

28:24.070 --> 28:24.960
Go now.

28:24.960 --> 28:26.160
Go and defy the imperial edict.

28:26.160 --> 28:27.400
I'm begging you.

28:27.400 --> 28:29.400
Don't stay here watching my drama unfold.

28:29.400 --> 28:30.440
Go now.

28:30.250 --> 28:32.820
[Persistence]

28:31.000 --> 28:31.830
Go.

28:32.200 --> 28:33.070
Go!

28:37.550 --> 28:38.110
Father!

28:38.110 --> 28:38.720
Father!

28:39.510 --> 28:40.440
Chu Guihong and I

28:40.440 --> 28:41.590
Chu Guihong and I

28:41.590 --> 28:42.830
were betrothed by our parents.

28:42.830 --> 28:44.240
were betrothed by our parents.

28:44.240 --> 28:45.110
There's no affection between us.

28:45.110 --> 28:46.160
There's no affection between us.

28:46.160 --> 28:48.070
But it's different
with the Seventh Prince.

28:48.070 --> 28:50.120
We truly love each other, Father.

28:51.590 --> 28:53.160
Even if one day,

28:53.350 --> 28:54.950
he becomes the crown prince,

28:55.310 --> 28:57.440
I'll stand with him
through thick and thin.

28:57.440 --> 28:59.370
If he falls from grace
and loses everything,

28:59.370 --> 29:01.500
I'll stay by his side till the very end!

29:02.680 --> 29:04.810
I'll stay by his side till the very end!

29:06.150 --> 29:12.170
♪ Eyes dulled, enduring all the scorn ♪

29:09.200 --> 29:11.110
Do you really mean that?

29:12.070 --> 29:14.590
So everything you said to me before

29:13.350 --> 29:15.990
♪ Pages curled, spare me more thorns ♪

29:16.110 --> 29:18.790
about wanting to avoid the Seventh Prince
at all cost

29:17.480 --> 29:19.590
♪ I've seen through every illusion ♪

29:20.580 --> 29:26.630
♪ Strip the paint, let me choose
what's true ♪

29:21.860 --> 29:23.580
was all a lie?

29:24.920 --> 29:26.440
Of course not.

29:26.440 --> 29:28.830
I wish to run away as far as I can
right now.

29:27.830 --> 29:30.730
♪ If the heart has glimpsed the fire
on the plain ♪

29:30.160 --> 29:31.000
Yes!

29:32.100 --> 29:36.210
♪ Then let me be the moth again ♪

29:35.290 --> 29:36.290
Even if today

29:36.830 --> 29:38.590
I'm condemned by all

29:39.880 --> 29:41.280
and cast out by my own kin,

29:42.070 --> 29:43.830
I'll still marry him!

29:42.710 --> 29:48.620
♪ Eyes dulled, enduring all the scorn ♪

29:48.400 --> 29:50.350
You disgraceful child!

29:50.300 --> 29:52.980
♪ Pages curled, spare me more thorns ♪

29:53.230 --> 29:54.550
Guards!

29:53.970 --> 29:56.140
♪ I've seen through every illusion ♪

29:55.590 --> 29:57.910
Take her away and keep a close
watch on her!

29:57.220 --> 30:03.240
♪ The future is hazy, I wander with
the flow ♪

29:58.750 --> 30:00.850
Before marrying Chu Guihong,

30:01.880 --> 30:04.440
she's not allowed to take a single
step out of her room!

30:04.440 --> 30:05.240
Yes, My Lord.

30:05.080 --> 30:07.430
♪ Why does the pain run deep as
I seek the path back ♪

30:07.160 --> 30:08.630
Father! Father!

30:08.730 --> 30:12.690
♪ In a single night, all turns to
hollow sorrow ♪

30:08.830 --> 30:10.790
Please let me marry the Seventh Prince!

30:10.790 --> 30:12.890
We truly love each other!

30:13.440 --> 30:14.240
Father!

30:14.750 --> 30:15.550
Father!

30:16.200 --> 30:17.250
Father!

30:17.590 --> 30:18.560
Father!

30:18.680 --> 30:19.550
Father!

30:20.190 --> 30:24.150
[Pure of Heart]

30:21.480 --> 30:22.270
Song Yude.

30:22.560 --> 30:24.270
You were my childhood study companion.

30:24.270 --> 30:25.030
Ever since I ascended the throne,

30:25.030 --> 30:26.200
I've always protected you

30:26.200 --> 30:27.000
and trusted you.

30:27.000 --> 30:27.590
You're now

30:27.590 --> 30:29.240
the Minister of War,

30:29.240 --> 30:30.720
a man above all others!

30:31.160 --> 30:32.350
I just don't understand

30:32.350 --> 30:34.480
what you still have to complain about!

30:36.880 --> 30:37.880
I

30:38.510 --> 30:41.240
earnestly plead Your Majesty to
revoke the decree.

30:41.240 --> 30:43.240
It was your daughter who failed to
uphold propriety first,

30:43.240 --> 30:45.970
stirring public uproar by entangling
with Heng.

30:46.400 --> 30:47.480
What I did

30:47.700 --> 30:49.500
was solely to grant their union!

30:52.640 --> 30:53.510
Your Majesty.

30:56.330 --> 30:57.710
18 years ago,

30:58.350 --> 31:02.510
Your Majesty were intent on having the
Eighteenth Prince succeed the throne

31:02.510 --> 31:05.480
someday, so you betrothed my daughter
to General Chu.

31:05.480 --> 31:06.270
Now that

31:06.400 --> 31:09.000
the Eighteenth Prince's conduct
has faltered,

31:09.000 --> 31:12.310
Your Majesty fears that the Seventh Prince

31:12.310 --> 31:14.370
is cunning and difficult to control,

31:15.680 --> 31:17.140
so again, you intend to use my daughter

31:17.140 --> 31:18.340
as a snare to control

31:18.830 --> 31:21.750
the Seventh Prince completely.

31:28.430 --> 31:29.380
[Pure of Heart]

31:34.830 --> 31:37.240
Among all the civil and military officials
in the court,

31:37.240 --> 31:40.110
only you cunning old eel

31:40.130 --> 31:42.530
have the audacity to speak
such words to me.

31:44.060 --> 31:51.230
[Keep Calm]

31:44.790 --> 31:46.070
So in your opinion,

31:46.590 --> 31:49.070
who should I choose to be the
crown prince?

31:55.830 --> 31:58.830
Your Majesty, your uncertainty
about this betrothal

32:00.920 --> 32:01.980
actually reflects

32:02.270 --> 32:05.330
your uncertainty about the choice of
the crown prince.

32:08.920 --> 32:13.050
Now, the Gao family's support for
the Seventh Prince is gaining momentum,

32:13.760 --> 32:16.000
while the Chu family behind the
Eighteenth Prince

32:16.000 --> 32:18.530
has declined due to their defeat
in Pingrong.

32:18.750 --> 32:20.100
At this very moment,

32:20.350 --> 32:22.310
my daughter has intensified the conflict
between the two sides,

32:22.310 --> 32:23.840
with hostility at its peak.

32:24.550 --> 32:26.150
Should the two forces clash,

32:27.030 --> 32:28.720
the Eighteenth Prince will undoubtedly

32:28.720 --> 32:30.720
be the one to lose out.

32:34.590 --> 32:37.830
Your Majesty is trying to balance
the court

32:40.000 --> 32:42.350
and protect the Eighteenth Prince

32:43.070 --> 32:46.200
by agreeing to let my daughter marry the
Seventh Prince.

32:46.680 --> 32:47.590
This way,

32:48.480 --> 32:49.540
the Seventh Prince

32:50.110 --> 32:53.240
won't make a move against the
Eighteenth Prince for the time being,

32:53.240 --> 32:54.950
and his power will be weakened

32:55.310 --> 32:58.310
due to his departure from the capital
to govern a fief.

32:59.590 --> 33:01.000
You cunning old fox.

33:01.830 --> 33:02.790
Perhaps I should let you

33:02.790 --> 33:04.510
sit in my throne for a change.

33:05.270 --> 33:06.590
I dare not.

33:11.380 --> 33:13.480
The sovereign governs and the
minister obeys;

33:13.480 --> 33:15.480
father and son each play their part.

33:15.590 --> 33:18.650
But those who fear aren’t always
the ones of lower rank.

33:19.830 --> 33:21.110
Your Majesty is wise.

33:22.880 --> 33:25.080
My daughter defied the imperial order,

33:25.960 --> 33:28.240
and I'm filled with dread.

33:29.160 --> 33:31.750
What Song Yimeng defied was your order,

33:31.880 --> 33:33.640
not mine.

33:35.830 --> 33:39.110
Then what the Seventh Prince defied
was his fate,

33:40.030 --> 33:42.200
not Your Majesty's will.

33:55.270 --> 33:56.880
What if Song Yimeng's fate

33:56.880 --> 33:58.590
is to marry Heng?

34:06.590 --> 34:07.510
Your Majesty.

34:09.880 --> 34:11.150
I believe

34:12.400 --> 34:13.710
my daughter

34:13.840 --> 34:16.840
should marry someone who
truly cares for her

34:16.860 --> 34:18.860
and enjoy their wholehearted love.

34:19.030 --> 34:21.560
Your Majesty's love for your sons
is sincere,

34:22.230 --> 34:24.670
so is my love for my daughter.

34:25.550 --> 34:27.190
Then how do you know

34:27.190 --> 34:29.590
who truly cares for her?

34:30.440 --> 34:32.170
Is it necessarily Chu Guihong?

34:41.360 --> 34:42.639
Song Yude.

34:42.440 --> 34:48.670
[Pure of Heart]

34:43.110 --> 34:46.000
My consent to Heng and
Song Yimeng's marriage

34:46.280 --> 34:48.760
was supposed to be an expedient
with multiple benefits,

34:48.760 --> 34:50.590
yet you openly defy the imperial edict.

34:50.590 --> 34:52.920
What punishment do you think you deserve?

34:53.900 --> 34:55.620
I deserve to die.

34:53.980 --> 34:57.690
[Pure of Heart]

34:59.510 --> 35:02.110
Song Yimeng actually agreed to
the betrothal?

35:02.440 --> 35:03.440
Could it be that Miss Song

35:03.440 --> 35:05.920
has long been in love deeply
with Your Highness?

35:05.920 --> 35:06.800
Just look at her.

35:06.800 --> 35:09.130
Does she look like someone deeply in love?

35:09.630 --> 35:11.150
Besides, the one she was arranged
to marry today

35:11.150 --> 35:12.280
was Nan Heng,

35:12.280 --> 35:13.280
not Li Shiliu.

35:13.710 --> 35:15.230
Your Highness, you've put on
too many acts.

35:15.230 --> 35:17.560
I really can't tell anymore at this point.

35:17.960 --> 35:18.510
Well,

35:19.190 --> 35:20.550
since Miss Song agreed,

35:20.670 --> 35:22.550
doesn't that mean Your Highness has to
go govern a fief?

35:22.550 --> 35:23.750
What should we do now?

35:26.280 --> 35:27.670
Song Yimeng agreed,

35:28.000 --> 35:29.510
but Song Yude might not.

35:30.230 --> 35:32.150
He wouldn't be willing to

35:32.190 --> 35:33.280
marry his precious daughter off to me.

35:33.280 --> 35:34.540
Your Highness is wise.

35:34.670 --> 35:36.480
I heard from the Song Residence that

35:36.480 --> 35:37.840
Mr. Song locked

35:37.840 --> 35:39.800
Miss Song in the woodshed
in a fit of anger.

35:39.800 --> 35:41.280
She was in despair and trying to
end her life in there,

35:41.280 --> 35:42.440
threatening to starve herself

35:42.440 --> 35:43.570
to resist the order.

35:44.840 --> 35:46.690
She actually threatens to starve herself
in defiance?

35:46.690 --> 35:48.400
I don't understand, either.

35:48.590 --> 35:49.760
Logically speaking,

35:49.760 --> 35:50.670
Miss Song

35:50.670 --> 35:53.070
wouldn't starve for Your Highness, right?

35:54.360 --> 35:55.760
She's not doing it for me.

35:56.440 --> 35:58.440
She's only worried about Li Shiliu.

35:59.150 --> 36:00.050
So Miss Song

36:00.230 --> 36:02.090
wants to get out and see Li Shiliu?

36:04.670 --> 36:05.930
Why are you here again?

36:06.030 --> 36:06.800
Chief.

36:07.400 --> 36:09.530
Something bad happened in the palace.

36:10.970 --> 36:14.390
[Jiuyao Gate]

36:11.800 --> 36:12.590
Guihong.

36:12.630 --> 36:13.590
The purpose of us coming here today

36:13.590 --> 36:14.630
is to save Mr. Song.

36:14.630 --> 36:15.480
You're doing this for your Song Yimeng,

36:15.480 --> 36:16.400
and I'm doing this for my Yiting.

36:16.400 --> 36:17.150
That's why we must...

36:17.150 --> 36:18.630
That's why you mustn't
act impulsively, Your Highness.

36:18.630 --> 36:19.920
How could I be that kind of person?

36:19.920 --> 36:20.280
I...

36:21.440 --> 36:22.110
Heng.

36:22.630 --> 36:23.630
Stop right there!

36:24.440 --> 36:25.360
What's this supposed to mean?

36:25.360 --> 36:26.360
You didn't even greet me.

36:26.360 --> 36:27.820
Are you looking down on me?

36:30.480 --> 36:31.280
Chu Guihong.

36:31.920 --> 36:33.400
His Majesty will surely punish Mr. Song

36:33.400 --> 36:35.200
for defying the imperial edict.

36:35.360 --> 36:36.760
The Song family is in trouble today.

36:36.760 --> 36:39.020
If you've come for the same purpose as me,

36:39.070 --> 36:41.120
why don't we let go of our old grudges

36:41.230 --> 36:42.630
and resolve this matter together?

36:42.630 --> 36:43.630
What do you think?

36:44.400 --> 36:46.320
Mr. Song has a long-standing relationship
with the Qianyu Mansion.

36:46.320 --> 36:47.720
That's only reasonable.

36:52.190 --> 36:53.450
He left just like that?

36:54.120 --> 36:57.370
[Imperial Study]

36:58.800 --> 36:59.630
Song Yude.

37:00.510 --> 37:01.800
You defied the imperial edict

37:01.800 --> 37:02.800
and spoke insolently.

37:02.800 --> 37:04.220
You deserve death.

37:04.840 --> 37:06.480
Yet, considering your years of service
to our nation

37:06.480 --> 37:08.070
and your considerable merits,

37:08.070 --> 37:10.600
I sentence you to the punishment
of 30 lashes.

37:11.110 --> 37:12.840
Do you acknowledge your guilt?

37:13.710 --> 37:14.720
I

37:16.000 --> 37:17.260
acknowledge my guilt.

37:17.820 --> 37:20.790
[Imperial Study]

37:18.400 --> 37:19.230
Eunuch Liu.

37:19.840 --> 37:20.900
Yes, Your Majesty.

37:21.280 --> 37:22.740
Carry out the punishment.

37:31.410 --> 37:33.210
Please calm down, Your Majesty!

37:37.590 --> 37:38.190
Your Majesty.

37:38.190 --> 37:39.630
Please calm down, Your Majesty.

37:39.630 --> 37:42.590
Are you two also here to defy my order?

37:42.900 --> 37:44.110
Please wait a moment, Father!

37:44.110 --> 37:45.260
Me too!

37:46.240 --> 37:48.050
What are you doing here?

37:48.190 --> 37:49.000
The Imperial Study

37:49.000 --> 37:51.000
isn't a place for you to just drop by.

37:51.510 --> 37:52.590
No, I...

37:52.590 --> 37:54.390
Please calm down, Your Majesty.

37:57.510 --> 37:58.320
Your Majesty.

37:59.030 --> 38:00.460
Mr. Song is aged.

38:00.710 --> 38:02.230
If he were to take the 30 lashes,

38:02.230 --> 38:04.030
it would be like a death sentence.

38:04.030 --> 38:05.030
Besides,

38:05.060 --> 38:07.140
your birthday is in 10 days.

38:07.230 --> 38:09.110
Blood shall not be seen in the palace.

38:09.110 --> 38:10.040
Ridiculous.

38:10.360 --> 38:11.690
If that's the reason,

38:11.820 --> 38:14.150
I would rather not celebrate my birthday.

38:15.230 --> 38:16.030
Your Majesty.

38:16.510 --> 38:17.770
His Highness is right.

38:18.550 --> 38:20.030
Your Majesty has been wise all your life.

38:20.030 --> 38:22.150
You must not be stained with the reputation
of cruelly killing a loyal minister.

38:22.150 --> 38:23.510
We are risking our lives to
offer this counsel,

38:23.510 --> 38:25.070
only so that Your Majesty's name could be

38:25.070 --> 38:27.360
preserved with honor in the
records of time.

38:27.360 --> 38:30.110
I'm standing here just fine, aren't I?

38:30.440 --> 38:33.240
There's no need to think about
the records of time.

38:33.550 --> 38:34.150
Father!

38:34.150 --> 38:34.960
Shut up!

38:37.590 --> 38:38.440
Your Majesty.

38:39.230 --> 38:40.320
Mr. Song is aged.

38:41.710 --> 38:44.770
I'm willing to bear the punishment
in place of Mr. Song.

38:49.110 --> 38:50.110
Well, well, well.

38:50.800 --> 38:51.710
One is

38:52.150 --> 38:53.590
my son,

38:55.800 --> 38:57.950
and the other is the Empress's nephew.

38:58.960 --> 38:59.800
Yet today,

39:00.150 --> 39:02.210
you're both openly defying me

39:02.320 --> 39:04.030
for the sake of an outsider.

39:04.440 --> 39:06.570
You both want to save Song Yude, right?

39:12.630 --> 39:13.510
Very well.

39:13.920 --> 39:16.640
I'll give you a chance today.

39:17.230 --> 39:19.230
Whoever is willing to hand over
10,000 soldiers

39:19.230 --> 39:21.000
to guard the border in Dongshuo,

39:21.000 --> 39:22.790
I will grant their request.

39:30.590 --> 39:31.480
Your Majesty.

39:31.510 --> 39:32.640
This cannot be done.

39:33.360 --> 39:35.070
The Seventh Prince and Mr. Chu

39:35.110 --> 39:36.910
are both pillars of our country.

39:37.320 --> 39:39.710
How can they be punished because of me?

39:39.710 --> 39:41.840
I want to hear it from them personally!

39:43.590 --> 39:44.440
What?

39:45.280 --> 39:46.810
Why are you both silent now?

39:47.200 --> 39:50.140
Don't you both want to marry Song Yimeng?

39:50.380 --> 39:52.400
Aren't you both willing to suffer

39:52.400 --> 39:54.320
physical pain for a woman?

39:55.030 --> 39:57.230
As soon as you heard about
giving up military power,

39:57.230 --> 39:58.590
you both went quiet.

39:59.150 --> 40:00.230
Lost your voices?

40:02.000 --> 40:03.330
Guihong, are you crazy?

40:03.510 --> 40:04.320
Father!

40:05.070 --> 40:06.180
How about

40:06.360 --> 40:07.800
I take the punishment for Mr. Song?

40:07.800 --> 40:08.960
Get lost.

40:09.920 --> 40:10.710
I... I...

40:10.710 --> 40:11.510
Your Majesty.

40:11.670 --> 40:13.400
I'm willing to bear the punishment
in place of Mr. Song.

40:13.400 --> 40:14.030
Good.

40:14.030 --> 40:14.830
Your Majesty.

40:17.070 --> 40:17.990
However,

40:18.670 --> 40:20.300
your 10,000 Xuanjia Army soldiers

40:20.300 --> 40:22.690
will never return to your command again.

40:24.110 --> 40:24.920
Heng.

40:26.230 --> 40:28.000
You'd better think it through.

40:31.510 --> 40:32.630
I have.

40:33.710 --> 40:34.710
Song Yimeng

40:35.230 --> 40:37.630
is the principal consort I
worked so hard to secure,

40:37.630 --> 40:38.760
which makes Mr. Song

40:38.920 --> 40:40.030
my father-in-law.

40:40.590 --> 40:42.230
It's only natural to bear the punishment

40:42.230 --> 40:43.490
for my father-in-law.

40:46.030 --> 40:47.000
In that case,

40:48.070 --> 40:49.710
I'll grant your wish.

40:54.140 --> 40:55.080
Eunuch Liu.

40:56.030 --> 40:57.000
Carry out the punishment.
